Z||000002||Stoic||04-08-2001||04:50 PM||||'85 SE had the base nose, GTs had the aero.  '86 was the first year that the SEs had the aero nose as well as the 6 cyl (of course).  <P>------------------<BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||6
Z||000003||MrPBody||04-08-2001||07:19 PM||||Ditto the above.  My '85 SE had the coupe nose.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Oreif||04-08-2001||11:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Stoic:<BR><B>'85 SE had the base nose, GTs had the aero.  '86 was the first year that the SEs had the aero nose as well as the 6 cyl (of course).  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The 85 SE had the V-6 as an option. 85 SE had coupe nose. 86/87 SE had aero nose. The base engine for ALL SE's was the 4-cyl. But in 85 thru 87 the V-6 was an option.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
